Clear the militia from the Hellanmaa AO, collapse their communications, and destroy their ability to coordinate further operations.
"]];

player createDiaryRecord ["diary", ["Situation","
For several weeks an armed militia group has occupied forest roads and outlying villages in the Hellanmaa hinterland, presenting itself as a local self-defence movement. In practice it has established illegal checkpoints, intimidated civilians, and co-opted civilian radio infrastructure.
<br/>

<br/>
Higher command believes this is not a purely local problem. Encrypted traffic on the militia net is too disciplined for a pickup-truck outfit, and it is being routed through at least two repeater sites. It is believed the militia is working together with a VDV advisor.
<br/>

<br/>
The Finnish Defence Forces have set up a concealed staging area just south of a militia roadblock. From there we will conduct our operation.
<br/><br/>
<font size='18'>ENEMY FORCES</font>
<br/>
Local militia, Russian-equipped infantry and light vehicles
<br/><br/>
<font size='18'>FRIENDLY FORCES</font>
<br/>
Finnish Defence Forces jaeger platoon
